  <title>Document history</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Document history</gui></guiseq> lists
  <link xref="documents_window">documents</link> and their lines, the way
  <link xref="invoice_history"/> lists invoices.</p>

  <steps>
    <item><p>Choose the <gui>Customer</gui>, or check <gui>All
    customers</gui>. <gui>Total</gui> adds up the documents listed.</p></item>
    <item><p>Select a document to see its lines below. Check <gui>Select all
    documents</gui> or <gui>All products</gui> to see more at once, and type
    into the search boxes to narrow the lines down.</p></item>
  </steps>

  <p>Double click a document to open it as it was printed. Right click a
  line for its <gui>Product hub</gui>, or <gui>View invoice</gui> to see the
  document. The <link xref="documents_window"/> window also opens this one to
  copy a past document's lines.</p>

</page>
